            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 382216,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "@35334 The link to A1 is in the channel description. Please add your unit's workflow there directly. A photo of the checklist would be very helpful too.",
            "mentions": [
              35334
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 529990,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "Seeing the variations already, especially with specialized care like geriatrics. To keep T1 manageable, we should probably focus the first wave of standardisation. I propose we start with the General Adult and Older Adult units, as their workflows seem most similar. We can tackle Disability Support in a second phase. What does everyone think? D1",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M10",
            "speaker_id": 455653,
            "reply_to": "M9",
            "text": "Agree. That's a practical scope. It lets us solve the most common problems first.",
            "mentions": [],
