            "speaker_id": 382216,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, based on the workflow maps, I've drafted the first version of the Standard Patient Intake SOP (A2) and the unified Intake/Consent forms (A3). They are now ready for your review. Please focus on clarity, accuracy, and any potential gaps. This covers T2 and T3.",
