            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 529990,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Thanks for putting these together. I've reviewed both. The SOP in A2 is clear and the roles are well-defined. On the consent form in A3, I've suggested a minor wording change in section 3b to be more explicit about data sharing with partner services, just to be extra safe from a compliance standpoint.",
